    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[0].text
      value: "Hello there, Mr.  D'Amboise!\r\n\r\n\tI dare say it\u2019s been some
        time since I\u2019ve heard from you last, so I figured I\u2019d more likely
        be the one to extend the courtesy of a letter, and here we are. Been awful
        quiet as of late, but I\u2019ve only just recently come into some knowledge
        that may be of interest to us. I seem to recall our services being employed
        by that old Clancy to keep our peepers pricked for anything that may be providing
        unneeded competition for them."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[1].text
      value: "I seem to recall them offering to pay awful well if we found anything,
        too.\r\n\tAs it happens, I was making my rounds down 16th Street when I saw
        a man whom I have not had the displeasure of acquainting myself with in some
        time. Old trouble boy of mine. Don\u2019t remember who he might have been
        affiliated with, but seeing him around acting all shady is a sure sign of
        something amiss."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[2].text
      value: "All I can give you for now is his name, Ronald, but I\u2019ll be waiting
        if anything breaks bad. I\u2019m doubtful anything will make its way to the
        street, so it might be in our best interest to get some of our more hands-on
        associates into the building. Looks like some sort of bookshop? Place called
        Bearcat Burrow; look it up in one of those books of yours and maybe you\u2019ll
        find something worthwhile."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[3].text
      value: "But for now, I\u2019m afraid the night beckons to me once again. I\u2019ll
        look forward to our next correspondence, which better be from you to me.
        I am a lady, after all.\r\n\r\nCiao,\r\nLena"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[4].text
      value: "Dear Mr. D,\r\n\r\n\tLena told me about that bookshop what caught her
        eye today. I snuck in, got a look around, and I caught the name of the guy
        running things. He\u2019s called Alister. Not sure if you\u2019ve heard of
        him? I haven\u2019t, but he might be involved with the folks Lena spotted
        hanging around the front of the place. Don\u2019t have too much to tell you
        beyond that--there was a guy in there giving me dirty looks and I didn\u2019t
        want to test his patience."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[5].text
      value: "Especially if Lena\u2019s right about what\u2019s going on here. Definitely
        think she\u2019s on the right track based on how quick they wanted me out
        of there. Wednesday is probably the earliest I could come back to check things
        out without them remembering me, but I might need some direction. Mark up
        one of those blueprints of yours and send it my way if you can. Looked like
        something funny was going on in the back left corner? Probably be good to
        check that out. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7281634247693047768, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageData.Array.data[6].text
      value: "Look forward to hearing from you soon!  \n\nCharlie"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8126872563991681825, guid: bad6b6899ebfeee46a4de53b2c0aa36b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Hello there, Mr.  D'Amboise!\n\n\tI dare say it\u2019s been some time
        since I\u2019ve heard from you last, so I figured I\u2019d more likely be
        the one to extend the courtesy of a letter, and here we are. Been awful quiet
        as of late, but I\u2019ve only just recently come into some knowledge that
        may be of interest to us. I seem to recall our services being employed by
        that old Clancy to keep our peepers pricked for anything that may be providing
        unneeded competition for them."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
